<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0650_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Misty</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Could you repeat that? I can’t hear\nyou at all. Connection trash, I guess.\rMove along and call again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hi...\nOh, hi. What’s happenin’?\fEverything good with me.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We both know there’s way stronger\nBlock Bosses than me around, right?\fYou better be ready to work hard.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, but I got a lot\ngoin’ on... I’m busy lately...\rWell, Wednesday mornings I got some\nfree time. Try callin’ then?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh hi, I’m free today!\nLet’s scrap again, OK?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OK! So, I’ll see you at\nthe Saffron Dojo, then!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aw...\nThat make me sad...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I ain’t sure... You only makin’ plans\nwith me?\rDidn’t you make plans with\nsomebody else already?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.\fIf you stand me up, I’m finna be sad.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yeah, this Misty...\nHi, how you doin’?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We made plans to meet at\nthe Saffron Dojo.\rYou remember you meetin’ me?\nI been lookin’ forward to this...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you been through all of\nKanto yet? How is it,\fcompared to Johto? There’s a lot\fof beautiful views here, right?\rI ESPECIALLY love the Cape off\nRoute 25!\rI got SO many memories of stuff\nalong that coast...\rWhat kinda memories? Pfft!\nLike I’d tell you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That reminds me...\nThat weirdo who came through\fmy Block recently...\rThat was you who beat him and\nran him off, wasn’t it?\rI forgot to say good looks for that!\rEverybody in my Block deadass\nappreciate it. Good looks fr!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you heard?\nIf you beat all six people on Route 25\fwithout losin’ once, you get to make\fa true-love wish!\rYou ain’t hear about that?\nFr?\rWell, that’s ’cause I just made\nit up! Ha ha ha!</language>
	</row>
</body>
